        "original_id": "5dd230f5-3c24-5ee7-9fb0-88e59da6f58a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Abraham Bankier, Oskar Schindler\n- Companies: Rekord factory\n- Organizations: Nazi Party\n- Events: the Holocaust\n\nFacts:\n- Abraham Bankier was one of the owners of the Rekord factory.\n- Oskar Schindler took over the Rekord factory from its previous owners.\n- Oskar Schindler was a German industrialist, a spy, and a member of the Nazi Party.\n- Oskar Schindler is credited with saving about 1,200 Jews during the Holocaust.",
